格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"pi extension: DeepSeek V4 Pro Minimal-anchored bootstrap, then full Standard tools (port of dsh-anchored-standard)","id":"gh:1334939552","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"pi-deepseek-anchor","slug":"kxh4892636/pi-deepseek-anchor","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","pi-agent","pi-extension","pi-package"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"pi extension: DeepSeek V4 Pro Minimal-anchored bootstrap, then full Standard tools (port of dsh-anch"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"DeepSeek V4 Pro Minimal-anchored bootstrap, then full Standard tools (port of dsh-anchored-standard)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# pi-deepseek-anchor"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 中文说明：README.zh-CN.md"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"pi-deepseek-anchor enables the full-powered DeepSeek V4 Pro to run at full strength in pi, with sign"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ificantly improved results (Project2: 91–92 → 98–99)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Cause** DeepSeek V4 Pro selects its trajectory based on the API-visible tool catalog. With the def"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ault full catalog, the first response typically starts with \"Let me...\" and follows the Standard tra"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"jectory (Project2: 91–92). With the official Minimal pair (`bash` + `str_replace_editor`), the first"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" response starts with \"We need...\" and produces zero `let me` (Project2: 98–99). Staying on Minimal "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"permanently loses the full toolset. This extension applies Minimal only to request #1 and restores t"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"he full catalog from request #2, so both are retained in one session."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Or from GitHub:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Then `/reload` or restart pi. Works with the full-powered DeepSeek V4 Pro official release."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Manual fallback: copy `index.ts` to `~/.pi/agent/extensions/anchored-standard/index.ts` (global) or "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"`<project>/.pi/extensions/anchored-standard/index.ts` (project-local)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Behavior"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| | Request #1 (bootstrap) | Request #2+ (promoted) |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Tools | `bash` + `str_replace_editor`, byte-identical to the official Minimal preset | full pi too"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"l catalog |\n| System prompt | `You are a helpful software engineer assistant.` (46 chars) | persona "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"remains; stripped pi context returns as a user message |\n| Output budget | adapter default (no cap; "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"`bootstrapMaxTokens` is opt-in) | adapter default |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Promotion fires on the first durable signal: the first assistant message or the first tool call, whi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"chever comes first (`promoteOn: \"either\"` default). State is durable, so `/resume` and reload preser"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"first (`promoteOn: \"either\"` default). State is durable, so `/resume` and reload preserve the phase."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## pi adaptation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Upstream (dsh preset) | pi port |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Minimal tool rows | `pi.registerTool` overrides: `bash` uses the byte-identical Minimal descriptio"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"n and delegates to pi's built-in `createBashTool`; `str_replace_editor` implements the official sche"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ma and upstream filesystem semantics (`view` / `create` / `str_replace` / `insert`, 16000-char trunc"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ation, exact error messages) |\n| `tool-bootstrap` pre-step filter | `before_agent_start` + `before_p"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"rovider_request`: request #1 is Minimal-exact; late appends (e.g. pi-memory) are dropped on request "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"#1 and moved to a user message after promotion |\n| Persona row (`complete: true`) | `minimalPersona`"},{"id":"p18s7","text":" + `personaScope: \"always\"` (default): persona remains the system prompt for the whole session; stri"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"pped context is re-delivered as a user message from request #2 |\n| Durable event scan | phase derive"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"d from pi's durable session branch plus a `dsh-anchored-state` custom entry |\n| Zero-Anchored Standa"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"rd mode | `zeroAnchor: true` in `PI_DSH_ANCHOR_CONFIG` |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Verification"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"End-to-end with official `deepseek-v4-pro`, `reasoningEffort=max`, `--mode rpc`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Edit `DEFAULT_CONFIG` in `index.ts`, or override at runtime:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Keys: `bootstrapTools` (default `[\"bash\",\"str_replace_editor\"]`), `promoteOn` (`either` | `tool-call"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"` | `assistant-message`), `bootstrapMaxTokens` (optional; unset = no cap), `minimalPersona` (default"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" `true`), `personaScope` (`always` | `bootstrap`, default `always`), `personaText`, `stripContext`, "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"`zeroAnchor` (default `false`), `zeroAnchorText`, `editorMaxOutputChars` (default `16000`)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Verify & debug"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- `/dsh-anchor` prints the phase; `/dsh-anchor promote` promotes now; `/dsh-anchor on|off` re-arms/d"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"isables the bootstrap for the session.\n- The TUI footer shows `bootstrap: bash/str_replace_editor` u"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ntil promotion.\n- `PI_DSH_ANCHOR_DEBUG=1` dumps assembled payloads to `PI_DSH_ANCHOR_DEBUG_FILE` (de"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"fault `/tmp/dsh-anchor-debug.jsonl`)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Type check"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Adjust the three `paths` entries in `tsconfig.check.json` to the installed pi type-definition locati"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"st the three `paths` entries in `tsconfig.check.json` to the installed pi type-definition locations."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Files"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- `package.json` — pi package manifest\n- `index.ts` — pi extension (single file, zero runtime deps)\n"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"- `README.zh-CN.md` — Chinese documentation\n- `tsconfig.check.json` — type-check config\n- `LICENSE` "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"— MIT, including upstream copyright notices\n- `NOTICE` — upstream derivation notice"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT. `index.ts` is a port of the MIT-licensed upstream preset; original copyright notices are retain"},{"id":"p34s2","text":". `index.ts` is a port of the MIT-licensed upstream preset; original copyright notices are retained."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Upstream"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"This project is a pi port of `xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard`. The upstream README and methodology"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" are the basis for this port:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Repository: https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard\n- README: English · 中文"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
